msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stack each row as a card, via a per-cell `data-label`. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Stacks each part as a block and hides/labels the header accordingly."
msgstr "Impila ogni riga come una scheda, tramite un `data-label` per cella. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Impila ogni parte come blocco e nasconde/etichetta l'intestazione di conseguenza."

