#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/compose` — emit Instructure design tokens as Jetpack Compose (Kotlin), via Style\nDictionary. It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values and keeps the natively-typed\ntokens (colours, dimensions, numbers)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/compose` — emette i design token di Instructure come Jetpack Compose (Kotlin), via Style\nDictionary. Appiattisce l'IR in valori concreti a modalità singola e mantiene i token nativamente tipizzati (colori, dimensioni, numeri)."

#: platforms/compose/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
