msgstr "**Modalità scura con risorse icone SVG e manifesto**"

#: platforms/flutter/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/flutter` — emit Instructure design tokens as Flutter (Dart), via Style Dictionary. It\nflattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values and keeps the natively-typed tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/flutter` — emette i design token di Instructure come Flutter (Dart), tramite Style Dictionary. \nAppiattisce l'IR in valori concreti a modalità singola e mantiene i token tipizzati nativamente."

#: platforms/flutter/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateFlutter](functions/generateFlutter.md)"
msgstr "Rinomina e riesporta [generateFlutter](functions/generateFlutter.md)"

