msgid "The Rust source (a module of `pub const`s)."
msgstr "Il codice sorgente Rust (un modulo di `pub const`s)."

#: platforms/rust/src/functions/toRust.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**egui (Color32), the default format**"
msgstr "**egui (Color32), il formato predefinito**"

#: platforms/rust/src/functions/toRust.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**iced (Color), dark mode**"
msgstr "**iced (Color), modalità scura**"

#: platforms/rust/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/rust` — emit Instructure design tokens as Rust constants for the two mainstream native\nRust GUIs: **egui** (`Color32`) and **iced** (`Color`). Colours become the framework's colour\ntype; dimensions become `f32` (px). Web-rendered Rust UIs (Tauri, Dioxus-web, Leptos, Yew) should\nuse `@pantoken/css` instead."
msgstr "`@pantoken/rust` — emette i design token di Instructure come costanti Rust per le due GUI native principali in Rust: **egui** (`Color32`) e **iced** (`Color`). I colori diventano il tipo colore del framework; le dimensioni diventano `f32` (px). Le UI Rust renderizzate sul web (Tauri, Dioxus-web, Leptos, Yew) dovrebbero invece usare `@pantoken/css`."

#: platforms/rust/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateRust](functions/generateRust.md)"
msgstr "Rinomina e re-esporta [generateRust](functions/generateRust.md)"

