#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/foundation` — theme Foundation for Sites with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — tema per Foundation for Sites con i token Instructure."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Foundation è incentrato su Sass, quindi questo pacchetto fornisce due livelli. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) genera un partial Sass in stile `_settings` che indirizza le variabili di impostazione di Foundation verso `var(--instui-*)`, così una build Sass compila l'aspetto Instructure mantenendo il theming a runtime tramite le stesse custom properties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) genera una sottile sovrapposizione CSS che tematizza le classi compilate comuni (`.button`, `.callout`, link) allo stesso modo — utile quando si utilizza il CSS standard di Foundation e si vuole semplicemente sovrapporre i colori Instructure senza ricompilare."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [foundationCss](variables/foundationCss.md)"
msgstr "Rinomina e riesporta [foundationCss](variables/foundationCss.md)"

